      "widgets_values": [
        "先试听原句，再按实际音频调整 start_seconds/end_seconds，仅框选要替换的词；0–0.5 秒仅为示例。\nListen to the original and select the actual word interval; 0–0.5 seconds is only an example.\ntarget_transcript 为编辑后整句；本例仅将开头“你好”改为“您好”，保留后文。\nThe complete edited transcript changes only the opening greeting and keeps the remainder.\nduration_frames=0 使用模型生成长度；正值指定替换帧数。\nUse 0 for generated duration, or a positive frame count.\n源感知场景按实际播放时间补写；跨角色/静音选区设置 target_speaker。expected_view 可填已试听资产身份JSON，防止误用旧选区。\nFor source-aware scenes, choose target_speaker for cross-role/silence and optionally bind expected_view. Session/AUDIO retain FLOAT; the standard FLAC output is a playback export."
      ],
      "title": "使用说明 / Instructions"
